  "releaseNotes": "v1.10.0: NEW CreateBasicHashesStreaming() API for common file verification (CRC32, MD5, SHA-1, SHA-256) - 17.5x faster than all 70 algorithms. NEW HashAlgorithmNames constants class with 70 public constants to eliminate magic strings and enable IntelliSense. Perfect for download verification, archive validation, and legacy compatibility.",
